--============================================================
-- MULTI-ZONE EGG STEALER
--============================================================
--
-- PURPOSE:
-- Automatically finds available eggs inside selected zones,
-- moves to them, activates their EggPrompt, then returns
-- to the player's own Base1.
--
-- MOVEMENT MODES:
--   Tween    = Tween the character toward the destination.
--   Walk     = Use Humanoid:MoveTo().
--   Teleport = Teleport through zone loading points.
--
--============================================================
-- TELEPORT ZONE ROUTING
--============================================================
--
-- FIXED ZONE ORDER:
--
--   1. Forest
--   2. Savannah
--   3. Dessert
--   4. Antartic
--   5. Volcano
--   6. Beach
--
-- Zone Skip controls the teleport route.
--
-- FORWARD EXAMPLE:
--
-- Beach + Skip 0:
-- Forest -> Savannah -> Dessert -> Antartic
-- -> Volcano -> Beach
--
-- Beach + Skip 2:
-- Savannah -> Antartic -> Beach
--
-- Beach + Skip 4:
-- Volcano -> Beach
--
-- Beach + Skip 6:
-- Beach
--
--============================================================
-- RETURN ROUTING
--============================================================
--
-- The same logic is used in reverse after stealing.
--
-- Beach + Skip 0:
-- Beach -> Volcano -> Antartic -> Dessert
-- -> Savannah -> Forest -> Base
--
-- Beach + Skip 2:
-- Beach -> Antartic -> Savannah -> Base
--
-- Beach + Skip 4:
-- Beach -> Savannah -> Base
--
-- Beach + Skip 6:
-- Beach -> Base
--
-- This is specifically designed to give distant zones time
-- to load while travelling back toward the player's base.
--
--============================================================

